Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:33:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD prompt users to close cleanly reviewed patch-agent
 work

Ask for an explicit yes/no completion decision only after a review result has resolved findings, so unresolved review findings cannot be converted into a closed feature. The controller records the completion state on the patch-agent session, consumes yes/no replies before backend sends, and the terminal left pane highlights only chats waiting for that decision while hiding closed patch-agent sessions.
